Introducing the **Magnetite Nano-Seal**. Forget passive brushes; this is active magnetic micro-transport. We inject a biocompatible, magnetorheological fluid into the periodontal pocket. This fluid contains iron oxide nanoparticles suspended in a viscous base. When exposed to a high-frequency magnetic field generated by a small, resonant coil embedded in a dental retainer, the particles align instantly, creating a rigid, non-Newtonian gel state. This solidifies the fluid into a temporary, magnetic seal that expands to fill every microscopic crevice. The magnetic field acts as a dynamic clamp, holding the seal in place under high pressure from chewing. Simultaneously, the fluid’s viscosity prevents retraction into the gingival sulcus. By switching the field off, the seal liquefies and is safely expelled via a simple syringe flush. This paradigm shift moves cleaning from mechanical friction to magnetic containment, allowing for a perfect, zero-groove seal that stays put for minutes, trapping debris against the tooth surface before complete removal. It is pure physics, pure control. อีก
